Z||000000||cardealer||08-17-2001||10:41 PM||||today i got a sweet deal on a complete sbc 400 with a turbo 400. i dont know what i want to put it in. i DONT want to do another fiero swap, but would like something differant. i was thinking a s10 blazer but there is getting to be too many of those.<BR>any ideas?<BR>thanks<BR>tony||||reg||5
